From b574db59f56f93724e1ae26e02f6beb9c16a69e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mac125b <mac125b@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:02:58 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 41/52] metal: fewer stages on the verify pass (outputs
 bit-identical)

- graph reorder may move CONCAT/SOFT_MAX/DSV4_HC_PRE/POST/FILL/CUMSUM/ARGSORT/TOP_K/GATED_DELTA_NET/FLASH_ATTN_EXT/LIGHTNING_INDEXER
  (memory access fully described by src/dst; GGML_METAL_REORDER_EXT=0 disables; GGML_METAL_REORDER_FWD look-ahead)
- MoE reduce fusion for 9..16 experts (fusion max 32 nodes); product rounded alone (precise::fma(e,w,0)) = unfused MUL+ADD
- MoE reduce + following ADD (shared expert) in one dispatch (GGML_METAL_FUSE_MOE_ADD)
- SCALE + SILU in one dispatch (GGML_METAL_FUSE_SCALE_SILU)
- RMS_NORM + MUL + MUL (gated norm) in one dispatch (GGML_METAL_FUSE_NORM_MUL_MUL)
B=3 verify 29.56 -> 27.8 ms, B=1 20.50 -> 19.5 ms, barriers 1993 -> 1610

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
